47
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:11,080
to conflict, and psychological costs. The Elasticity Question.

48
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:21,120
The elasticity parameter, where e equals one point zero, represents shared enemy amplification where redirecting to disease

49
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:30,180
