51
00:05:35,980 --> 00:05:41,080
Or do humans, being humans, find a way to keep killing each other at full price?

52
00:05:42,200 --> 00:05:49,960
E equals zero point two five is the "humans are barely trainable" scenario, where only a quarter of cuts reduce violence.

53
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:58,180
E equals zero point five is the "humans are somewhat rational" scenario, which is historically optimistic.

54
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:06,040
E equals one point zero is a full match and the baseline assumption, though probably generous given your track record.

55
00:06:07,140 --> 00:06:14,960
